WEBVTT

00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:16.884
Abiru hodo dakiattari kuchizuke shitari

00:00:16.884 --> 00:00:23.090
Abiru hodo kenka shitari aishiattari

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:29.296
Ari no mama omae no koto shiritai kuse ni

00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:35.035
Ari no mama nante narenai ore no hou sa

00:00:35.369 --> 00:00:38.372
Wakaranai

00:00:38.372 --> 00:00:41.108
Omae no kokoro ga

00:00:41.542 --> 00:00:43.110
Nazedayo

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:47.748
Honto wa majutsushi kai?

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:51.919
Dakishimetai

00:00:51.919 --> 00:00:55.522
Hitori ja cry

00:00:55.522 --> 00:01:00.027
Mou nido to hitori ja itakunai

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:04.531
Dakishimetai

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:07.834
Omae to fly

00:01:08.235 --> 00:01:15.876
Marude naiteru youna kanjiteru koe ni toketeiku

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:22.115
Serenade

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:37.230
the end of my Journey

00:01:54.648 --> 00:01:56.483
This is...

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:59.753
If you die right now,
then my past six years...

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:11.598
What a pitiable person.

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:16.803
An average sorcerer has no hope
of taming the Sword of Baltanders.

00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:20.641
Even with Orphen, there's no guarantee.

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:26.346
Bloody August!

00:02:26.947 --> 00:02:28.382
Hey, Dortin!

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:36.690
Hang on! Hang on, Bloody August!

00:02:41.962 --> 00:02:43.630
What are you doing?

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:45.232
We have to hurry up and get away!

00:02:45.232 --> 00:02:47.501
We don't know what kind of
awful thing will happen

00:02:47.501 --> 00:02:49.369
if we stay in this dangerous place!

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:52.205
Big Brother, lend me a hand.
Take the sword out.

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:54.207
What kind of idiocy are you spouting?!

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:55.208
Hurry up and run...

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:56.143
Big Brother!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.211
Lend me your strength!

00:03:00.313 --> 00:03:01.148
Yes...

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:27.874
It's alive.

00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:30.477
Bloody August is still alive!

00:03:30.744 --> 00:03:31.578
What?

00:03:32.946 --> 00:03:36.450
But its heartbeat is getting
weaker and weaker!

00:03:36.717 --> 00:03:38.218
At this rate...

00:03:42.456 --> 00:03:43.523
Orphen!

00:03:48.929 --> 00:03:49.996
To my hand!

00:04:23.497 --> 00:04:24.664
Childman...

00:04:24.998 --> 00:04:26.133
Azalie...

00:04:35.776 --> 00:04:38.912
I've caused you to suffer
painful memories, Azalie.

00:04:38.912 --> 00:04:40.113
It's my...

00:04:40.113 --> 00:04:42.616
It's my fault, mine!

00:04:44.484 --> 00:04:48.889
| was wrong, because I wasn't able
to accept your feelings.

00:04:49.189 --> 00:04:51.625
Because of me, you...

00:04:51.625 --> 00:04:52.826
Forgive me.

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:55.629
That's... that's...

00:04:55.629 --> 00:04:57.397
| won't let you die.

00:04:57.397 --> 00:04:59.299
| can't let you die!

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:01.902
Because you are more important
to me than anyone!

00:05:05.906 --> 00:05:07.474
What are you planning to do?

00:05:07.974 --> 00:05:08.909
Azalie!

00:05:08.909 --> 00:05:10.410
It's White Magic.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:13.613
She intends to change souls
with Bloody August, again!

00:05:13.613 --> 00:05:17.017
But Bloody August is dying!

00:05:17.017 --> 00:05:19.719
If she does something like that,
Miss Azalie will die!

00:05:20.287 --> 00:05:24.491
There is nothing I can do to atone
for the sins I have committed.

00:05:24.491 --> 00:05:27.727
But saving you is something that I can do.

00:05:27.727 --> 00:05:29.596
Don't, Azalie!

00:05:38.238 --> 00:05:40.340
Childman, why?!

00:05:40.874 --> 00:05:45.011
From that day, I lived only to save you.

00:05:45.979 --> 00:05:48.381
It's all right. It's all right now.

00:05:48.381 --> 00:05:50.817
Don't! You can't do that!

00:05:51.484 --> 00:05:56.723
I'm glad that I was able to see you
once more while I lived.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.192
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:06:05.165 --> 00:06:06.366
Krylancelo!

00:06:10.303 --> 00:06:12.105
What are you so maudlin about?

00:06:12.906 --> 00:06:15.008
| am going to save both of you!

00:06:15.008 --> 00:06:16.109
With this sword!

00:06:21.248 --> 00:06:23.350
Stop, Krylancelo!

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.318
You mustn't use that sword!

00:06:26.853 --> 00:06:28.088
Childman?

00:06:28.088 --> 00:06:29.122
What?

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:36.463
Armour of Ice, that doth spin around me!

00:06:43.837 --> 00:06:45.505
Towers of Heaven, that do dance around me!

00:06:47.741 --> 00:06:49.142
What are you doing?!

00:06:53.446 --> 00:06:54.581
Orphen!

00:06:54.581 --> 00:06:55.982
Master!

00:07:04.891 --> 00:07:07.127
If you want to die so much, then die.

00:07:07.127 --> 00:07:10.196
But only after I have returned you
to your former form!

00:07:10.563 --> 00:07:13.266
I'm such a lucky person, but...

00:07:16.102 --> 00:07:19.239
If you plan to deny me use of the sword,
then I'll be your opponent!

00:07:19.239 --> 00:07:21.708
Sword of the Descending Demon,
that I do carry!

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:25.779
Stop! Please stop already!

00:07:26.212 --> 00:07:28.415
There's no reason for the two of you to fight!

00:07:28.415 --> 00:07:30.050
I'm the only one in the wrong!

00:07:30.717 --> 00:07:32.552
So, please stop already!

00:07:45.632 --> 00:07:47.133
Azalie!

00:07:47.434 --> 00:07:51.671
Thank you, Krylancelo, but this is all my fault.

00:07:52.505 --> 00:07:55.909
So, I will end all this with my own hands.

00:07:57.077 --> 00:08:01.348
Farewell, my beloved younger brother.

00:08:38.585 --> 00:08:39.786
It failed.

00:08:40.453 --> 00:08:43.723
Azalie has returned to
the body of Bloody August,

00:08:43.723 --> 00:08:47.427
but Childman's body has been
destroyed by the sword's magic.

00:08:48.628 --> 00:08:49.929
And that?

00:08:50.363 --> 00:08:54.234
Probably Azalie and Childman's souls.

00:08:55.001 --> 00:08:57.737
What will happen to the two of them?

00:08:58.838 --> 00:09:01.841
Two souls can't enter one body.

00:09:02.542 --> 00:09:06.946
At this rate, both souls will
lose their way and be destroyed.

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:09.682
We have to save them fast!
What should we do?

00:09:12.152 --> 00:09:13.987
Well, that, even I...

00:09:15.622 --> 00:09:16.623
Orphen?

00:09:18.224 --> 00:09:19.993
I'll save both of them.

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:21.761
| can do it.

00:09:23.663 --> 00:09:25.665
Because I did promise.

00:09:26.299 --> 00:09:28.802
As long as I don't fulfill that promise,

00:09:28.802 --> 00:09:32.038
| won't be able to move forward,
not even one step.

00:09:33.206 --> 00:09:34.507
Six years...

00:09:34.507 --> 00:09:39.679
I've been trying to save you
for six long years.

00:09:43.349 --> 00:09:45.452
| am thankful to you too.

00:09:45.452 --> 00:09:48.655
Because of you, I was able to meet
my irreplaceable friends,

00:09:48.655 --> 00:09:51.891
partner and apprentice.

00:09:56.596 --> 00:09:59.566
But I won't accept this ending. Not at all!

00:09:59.799 --> 00:10:04.003
I'll decide it, with the memories of
these past six years behind me!

00:10:08.041 --> 00:10:09.209
That's right.

00:10:09.209 --> 00:10:12.345
Orphen always keeps his promises, doesn't he?

00:10:12.345 --> 00:10:13.713
I'll believe.

00:10:13.713 --> 00:10:15.882
After all, I'm his partner.

00:10:15.882 --> 00:10:18.551
After all, he did promise he wouldn't die!

00:10:22.355 --> 00:10:24.224
Master can do it.

00:10:24.224 --> 00:10:27.460
Isn't that why we've continued
this painful journey?

00:10:27.727 --> 00:10:30.763
There's so much more
that I'd like him to teach me.

00:10:31.297 --> 00:10:34.701
| don't want you to forsake
this half-baked apprentice, okay?

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:20.547
Holy Blade of Light, whom I do release!

00:12:08.895 --> 00:12:10.163
Childman...

00:12:20.106 --> 00:12:21.608
| told you, didn't 1?

00:12:21.608 --> 00:12:24.777
That I would save both of you.

00:12:28.448 --> 00:12:29.616
Orphen!

00:13:18.798 --> 00:13:22.201
They didn't come after all.

00:13:22.435 --> 00:13:26.939
Well, I guess that's only right, everyone has
started walking their separate paths now.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:28.741
What's wrong,

00:13:29.942 --> 00:13:31.010
Steph?

00:13:31.811 --> 00:13:35.782
Nothing. I'm just too happy.

00:13:37.483 --> 00:13:38.551
Tim.

00:14:05.345 --> 00:14:08.314
That was a wonderful performance, Cleao.

00:14:08.715 --> 00:14:10.616
Oh, Mother...

00:14:10.883 --> 00:14:13.953
Now, come along. Afternoon tea is ready.

00:14:13.953 --> 00:14:16.155
Yes, let's go now, Leki.

00:14:30.503 --> 00:14:32.939
It's not something you get better at quickly.

00:14:33.272 --> 00:14:35.174
But what's happening, Cleao?

00:14:35.174 --> 00:14:38.144
All of the sudden you want to
learn the sewing arts.

00:14:38.144 --> 00:14:40.646
You didn't have any interest in it at all until now.

00:14:41.848 --> 00:14:44.884
Oh, because the journey's over now.

00:14:45.351 --> 00:14:48.154
From now on, I have to find my own path.

00:14:48.154 --> 00:14:51.190
Yes, that journey did change you.

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:52.392
Big Sister?

00:14:52.725 --> 00:14:54.694
Our late father said that too.

00:14:54.694 --> 00:14:57.497
Life isn't something
bestowed upon you by others.

00:14:57.797 --> 00:15:00.099
It's something you carve out for yourself.

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:02.001
Yes!

00:15:07.473 --> 00:15:10.576
Big Brother, if you slack off,
then you'll get yelled at again.

00:15:14.914 --> 00:15:17.216
Why? Why is it, Dortin?

00:15:17.216 --> 00:15:20.586
Why does the battle hound of Mazmaturia,
this Volcan Polkano,

00:15:20.586 --> 00:15:24.724
have to peel potatoes in a place like this?

00:15:25.391 --> 00:15:26.993
Isn't it all right, Big Brother?

00:15:26.993 --> 00:15:29.262
If we work steadily like this,

00:15:29.262 --> 00:15:32.432
then at least we don't have
any trouble with food.

00:15:32.932 --> 00:15:36.335
You, don't you know the phrase,
"Get rich quick?"

00:15:36.335 --> 00:15:39.639
And you, Big Brother, don't you know
the phrase, "Scholarly ability?"

00:15:40.673 --> 00:15:42.642
Geez, my patience is at it's end!

00:15:42.642 --> 00:15:46.412
Now that I'm here, I'll just steal
all the valuables in this house,

00:15:46.412 --> 00:15:51.250
sell them for cash, and from
this day on I'll have a clean body!

00:15:51.751 --> 00:15:56.556
Quit it, Big Brother.
You'll have a clean body, but a dirty life.

00:15:56.556 --> 00:15:58.658
Shut up! Don't lecture your big brother!

00:15:58.658 --> 00:16:00.927
I'll steam you to death with a pressure cooker!

00:16:13.039 --> 00:16:15.475
Leki, I've been looking for you.

00:16:15.475 --> 00:16:17.176
Let's go shopping.

00:16:18.611 --> 00:16:21.147
Go with God!

00:16:27.153 --> 00:16:28.921
Good afternoon, Uncle.

00:16:29.255 --> 00:16:33.459
Cleao, you look well. Are you shopping?

00:16:33.459 --> 00:16:36.262
Yes, Mother asked me to go on an errand.

00:16:36.262 --> 00:16:38.931
Yesterday a letter from Majic arrived.

00:16:39.398 --> 00:16:42.168
It seems he's doing well at the Tower of Fangs.

00:16:42.869 --> 00:16:44.203
Is that so?

00:16:44.904 --> 00:16:47.240
But that's good for Majic.

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:50.810
He'll finally get his wish
and become a sorcerer!

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:53.312
Well, see you later, Uncle!

00:17:07.026 --> 00:17:08.394
Childman...

00:17:09.161 --> 00:17:11.531
this is my atonement.

00:17:17.136 --> 00:17:18.304
O Lightning!

00:17:18.871 --> 00:17:20.106
O Lightning!

00:17:20.773 --> 00:17:21.974
O Lightning!

00:17:23.743 --> 00:17:26.345
What? That's funny.

00:17:26.345 --> 00:17:30.216
If you put too much heart into it,
it's not good for your body, Majic.

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:34.186
Magic isn't something that you
suddenly improve at, you know.

00:17:35.254 --> 00:17:37.523
Well, that's true, but...

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:41.193
You know, something is weird.

00:17:41.193 --> 00:17:42.128
Weird?

00:17:42.128 --> 00:17:44.230
| don't understand it well myself,

00:17:44.230 --> 00:17:46.465
but it seems like something's
missing all of a sudden.

00:17:46.465 --> 00:17:48.034
Something's missing?

00:17:48.034 --> 00:17:52.872
Yes, I thought it was because
my environment has changed,

00:17:53.239 --> 00:17:55.074
but it seems like that's not the case.

00:17:55.074 --> 00:17:56.576
| wonder what it is?

00:17:56.976 --> 00:17:59.145
Well, just take it easy.

00:18:05.685 --> 00:18:07.186
O Lightning,

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:08.955
O Lightning.

00:18:11.023 --> 00:18:12.325
Master...

00:18:16.462 --> 00:18:17.830
That's it!

00:18:23.569 --> 00:18:26.706
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:18:29.375 --> 00:18:31.077
W-wow!

00:18:31.077 --> 00:18:34.480
What? So that's it! So that's what it was.

00:18:48.294 --> 00:18:49.562
Majic!

00:18:49.562 --> 00:18:50.830
Eris?

00:18:51.631 --> 00:18:53.599
Why are you leaving?

00:18:53.599 --> 00:18:57.637
Just when you've finally become friends
with everyone and your magic is improving!

00:18:57.637 --> 00:18:59.238
Why are you unhappy?

00:18:59.238 --> 00:19:01.107
That's not it, Eris.

00:19:01.107 --> 00:19:02.908
| just remembered.

00:19:03.342 --> 00:19:06.212
I've wanted to be a sorcerer for a long time.

00:19:06.212 --> 00:19:08.280
But that's not quite it.

00:19:08.614 --> 00:19:11.183
What I wanted to be, yeah...

00:19:12.318 --> 00:19:16.222
| wanted to be the sorcerer
that was his best apprentice.

00:19:16.455 --> 00:19:17.757
Majic...

00:19:30.102 --> 00:19:32.338
Well, that's how it is.

00:19:33.339 --> 00:19:34.640
Wait!

00:19:35.141 --> 00:19:36.308
Majic...

00:19:37.276 --> 00:19:40.479
If the Master's the Master,
then the apprentice's the apprentice.

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:43.382
Neither one will stick around.

00:19:43.816 --> 00:19:47.486
They're probably both strays then.

00:19:51.223 --> 00:19:55.194
No! No more! Definitely no more!

00:19:58.431 --> 00:20:02.334
I guess I'm just not cut out
for this girlish hobby stuff.

00:20:02.334 --> 00:20:05.104
It was a lot more fun on the journey.

00:20:38.838 --> 00:20:39.839
Leki...

00:20:43.175 --> 00:20:44.744
Leki, let's go.

00:21:25.484 --> 00:21:27.486
Master!

00:21:28.654 --> 00:21:30.156
Cleao!

00:21:34.827 --> 00:21:39.632
So, let's go on a journey, Majic, Cleao!

00:21:42.401 --> 00:21:44.570
Yes, Master!

00:22:11.997 --> 00:22:13.532
Doushiyou

00:22:13.532 --> 00:22:15.935
Oikakete kurenakya

00:22:15.935 --> 00:22:20.172
Konomama zun zun to aruitatte

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:23.309
Doushiyou

00:22:23.309 --> 00:22:25.744
Aenaku naru yo

00:22:25.744 --> 00:22:30.049
Keitai denwa o shittetatte

00:22:30.616 --> 00:22:35.487
Headlights watashi o terasu

00:22:35.487 --> 00:22:39.792
Mabushi sugite me o tojiru

00:22:40.426 --> 00:22:42.828
Heels nugisutete

00:22:42.828 --> 00:22:45.297
Ryoute ni moteba

00:22:45.297 --> 00:22:50.369
Pride nanka mo sutechaeru

00:22:50.536 --> 00:22:59.111
Hajimete sugoku hikyou na mo shisou na no yo

00:23:00.312 --> 00:23:10.990
Kono mama michi ni taorekonde nakijakuritai

00:23:11.924 --> 00:23:16.428
Looking for you and fall in love

00:23:17.162 --> 00:23:21.367
Tsuyoku mo so naindakara

00:23:22.101 --> 00:23:26.171
Ima kiss o saretara

00:23:26.906 --> 00:23:31.610
Naichauyo doushiyou

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:37.616
<i>Kono koi 0 doushiyou</i>
